Answer: You can use `Pattern.quote()` method and `Matcher.replace()` method to achieve this:

\begin{code}
public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
    String sentence = "The student ran quickly to school";
    String pattern = String.format("(?i)\\bran\\b","");
    String replacement = "ran quickly";
    Matcher matcher = Pattern.compile(pattern).matcher(sentence);
    while (matcher.find()) {
        System.out.println(matcher.replaceAll(replacement));
    }
}
\end{code}

