Construct a 3x2 matrix with integers from 1 to 6 in ascending order.

## Examples

```
result = [1, 2]
```

## Notes

- This is a common question that can be answered in multiple ways.
- I choose the easiest one:
  - calculate next number
  - swap it
  - check if next number is larger than current number
  - if yes, repeat the process

## Solution

```
function constructMatrix(start,end) {
  const result = [];
  for (let i = 0; i < start; i++) {
    result.push(i + 1);
  }
  for (let i = start; i < end; i++) {
    result.push(i + 1);
  }

  return result;
}
```

