Find the maximum value in the given dataset.
Data: Salary of 10 Employees
Employee A: $24,000  Employee B: $21,000 Employee C: $27,000  
Employee D: $19,000  Employee E: $20,000 Employee F: $25,000 
Employee G: $22,000  Employee H: $18,000 Employee I: $26,000 
